    "bounding box" : [ 72.0, 532.469, 541.276, 572.208 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "x(θ,ˆ ϕˆ) = r(θ,ˆ ϕˆ)r(θ,ˆ ϕˆ), r(θ,ˆ ϕˆ) = sin ϕ ˆ cos θ ˆ ,sin ϕ ˆ sin θ ˆ ,cos ϕ ˆ . (24) For Chart B, we use"
